      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "HPV virus-like-particle vaccination is a landmark preventive intervention with direct potential to eliminate major cancers.",
        "attribution": "The proposed trio captures central scientific contributions to the vaccine concept and its realization, while acknowledging a substantial wider clinical-development effort.",
        "maturity": "Long-term efficacy, implementation, and cancer-prevention effects make this a highly mature body of work.",
        "uncertainties": [
