        "attribution": "Benabid is a clear central figure for the specified high-frequency stimulation advance.",
        "maturity": "Decades of clinical use, refinement, and benefit make the contribution exceptionally mature.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Its extension across neurological and psychiatric indications should not be conflated with the original Parkinson's disease discovery."
        ]
      }
    },
