        "nobel_worthiness": "Chaperonin-assisted folding established a fundamental mechanism by which cells achieve proteome function and avoid misfolding.",
        "attribution": "Hartl and Horwich are strongly and complementarily associated with the central mechanistic discovery.",
        "maturity": "The findings have remained foundational across molecular and cellular biology for decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Other components of the broader protein-folding field may complicate a narrowly chaperonin-focused attribution."
        ]
      }
    },
