        "nobel_worthiness": "The delineation of distinct B- and T-cell lineages provided a foundational framework for modern adaptive immunology.",
        "attribution": "Miller and Cooper are directly associated with the complementary lineage discoveries specified here.",
        "maturity": "The conceptual and experimental framework has been repeatedly confirmed and underlies contemporary immunology.",
